\begin{itemize}
\item[(i)]
$\pi$ has zero relative topological entropy if and only if so does $\widetilde{\pi}$.
\item[(ii)]
$\pi$ has positive relative topological entropy if and only if $\widetilde{\pi}$ has infinite relative mean dimension.
\end{itemize}

