Let $M$ be a closed manifold. Let $L\colon TM\longrightarrow \R$ be a Tonelli Lagrangian and let $V\in C^2(M)$ be such that  $\max_M V = 0$. Then:
\begin{enumerate}[label=\textbf{(\roman*)},ref=(\roman*)]
