}
\item\label{Mane point 3} Let $M=\T^n$ and $L(x,v)=\ell(v)$, i.e., it is a completely integrable system. Let $h\in H_1(M;\R)\setminus\{0\}$. Then, considering $\ell_V:=\ell+V$:
